  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAUTAPO Vocational Training - FAUTAPO Inst Support civ soc</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAUTAPO Yrkesutbildning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAUTAPO provided vocational and productive education in Bolivia,      promoting opportunities for improved living conditions through a      productive role in society for young women and men as well as         contributing to the diversification of economic growth and a more     equal distribution of income. Sweden give a non-earmarked support to  with an amount of MSEK 35 for de period of aug 2011 to dec 2013.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAUTAPO verkar f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade levnadsf&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden f&#xf6;r unga m&#xe4;n och   kvinnor genom m&#xf6;jligheter till yrkesutbildning och &#xf6;kade inkomster    samt diversifierad ekonomi och kunskapsutveckling inom                yrkesutbildning.  St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r riktat till organisationen strategiska    plan 2011-2015. Sverige st&#xf6;djer FAUTAPO med 35 000 000 f&#xf6;r perioden   augusti 2011 - december 2013.</narrative>
  </description>
